findings.comment:
Floor was observed to be soiled with general buildup and debris in the following areas:
1. Under soda and slush machines in front service area;
2. Under left ice machine;
3. Under cookline equipment

750.8000e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) general surfaces under grill (grease);
B) above/around toaster (grease);
C) walls of tot and fry hot holding (grease);
D) upright reach-in cooler - shelving, bottom inside, gaskets (general buildup/food crumbs);
E) upright reach-in freezer - bottom inside, gaskets (general buildup/food crumbs);  and
F) shelving in front of small 3 part sink up front (general soil).
***Clean general surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
